     "type": "code",
     "head": "The cashier in code",
     "say": "Here's the cashier. Coins go biggest first. For each coin, take as many as fit using division, and keep the remainder. Six: one four, remainder two, no threes, then two ones. It prints three, but the best is two.",
     "panels": [
      {
       "file": "sol.cpp",
       "code": "int greedyCoins(vector<int> c, int amt) {\n    int n = 0;\n    for (int x : c) {\n        n += amt / x;\n        amt %= x;\n    }\n    return n;\n}\nint main() { cout << greedyCoins({4, 3, 1}, 6); }"
      }
     ],
